The SSH agent
.Nm build Fl -ssh
gives a step when no socket is named.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /var/db/jailer
Default state directory for root.
.It Pa ~/.docker/config.json
Registry credentials, also read from
.Pa $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/containers/auth.json
and
.Pa ~/.config/containers/auth.json .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Nm run
exits with the container's exit status.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Scaffold, build, test, and publish an image:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
jailer init
jailer build --strict
doas jailer run
jailer push ghcr.io/me/app:1.0
.Ed
.Pp
Publish one name for amd64 and arm64 nodes, building on each:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
arm64$ doas jailer build -t app:1.0
arm64$ doas jailer push app:1.0 ghcr.io/me/app:1.0-arm64
amd64$ doas jailer build -t app:1.0
amd64$ doas jailer manifest push ghcr.io/me/app:1.0 \e
           app:1.0 ghcr.io/me/app:1.0-arm64
.Ed
.Pp
Produce an archive for an offline Legion node:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
jailer export app.tar
legion image load app.tar --zfs-root zroot/legion
.Ed
